          <title>Waldschmidt walks off LA with 2-run HR as D-backs hand Dodgers 7th straight loss</title>
          <description><![CDATA[Rookie Ryan Waldschmidt hit a two-run homer in the ninth inning off closer Edwin Diaz to give the Arizona Diamondbacks 4-3 victory over Los Angeles on Friday night, sending the Dodgers to their season-high seventh straight loss.]]></description>
